-- Important implementation notes:
-- 1) Always scope reads/updates/deletes by the authenticated user_id in the backend.
-- 2) Validate that portfolio_id and credit_card_id belong to the same user_id before insert;
--    simple foreign keys alone do not enforce cross-table ownership.
-- 3) Hash passwords server-side with Argon2id (preferred) or bcrypt; never store raw passwords.
-- 4) Do not store full card numbers, CVV, PIN, or banking credentials.
-- 5) In production, use migrations, least-privilege DB credentials, TLS, backups, and secrets
--    from environment/secret management rather than hard-coding credentials.
